parts.text:
An old document from Brazil, dated August 1891, is presented. It is a page from the "DIARIO OFFICIAL" (Official Gazette). The layout is divided into three columns.

Here is the complete HTML code representing the layout and text of the document:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Diario Official - Agosto 1891</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
            background-color: #fcfaf2;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .document-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }
        header {
            border-bottom: 3px double #000;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .header-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            flex-grow: 1;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .header-date {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        .columns-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            column-gap: 20px;
            text-align: justify;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .column {
            position: relative;
        }
        /* Vertical dividers */
        .column:not(:last-child)::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: -10px;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 1px;
            background-color: #000;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .subsection-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        p {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            text-indent: 15px;
        }
        .no-indent {
            text-indent: 0;
        }
        /* Table styling for Balancete */
        .balancete-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .balancete-table td {
            padding: 1px 0;
            vertical-align: bottom;
        }
        .dots {
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #000;
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin: 0 5px;
        }
        .table-row-flex {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }
        .bold-text {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .center-text {
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="document-container">
    <header>
        <div class="header-top">
            <div>Sabbado 1</div>
            <div class="header-title">DIARIO OFFICIAL</div>
            <div class="header-date">Agosto (1891) <strong>601</strong></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="columns-container">
        <!-- COLUMN 1 -->
        <div class="column">
